{
  "$comment": "Single source of truth for Bedrock on-demand model prices. TypeScript imports this file directly (packages/pricing/src/index.ts); the Lambda cost publisher's table (terraform/components/cost-pipeline/lambda/pricing_data.py) is generated from it by scripts/gen-lambda-pricing.mjs and drift-checked in CI. Refresh from the AWS Pricing API with scripts/refresh-pricing.mjs. Never hand-edit prices from memory — Bedrock pricing changes regularly and stale numbers silently undercount spend.",
